+`ef519ad7`; state of the byte check taken at `d58d56b8`/`3a1aa7ed` during the same cycle):
+`government/LAWS.md` §§32-33; `government/OVERSIGHT.md`; the finding above;
+`government/statistics-trial-design-verifier.py`; `government/knowledge-phase-verifier.py`;
+`government/statistics-first-trial.py`; `records/knowledge/first-trial-source-dict-20261123-phase1.json`;
